@startuml
node "Brauser" {
  [Reacti veebileht] as Web
}
node "Server" {
  [Restoran.Api] as Api
  [Restoran.Application] as App
  [Restoran.Infrastructure] as Infra
  database "SQLite restoran.db" as Db
  [Restoran.Worker] as Worker
}
Web --> Api : HTTP / JSON
Web <--> Api : WebSocket /ws/tables
Api --> App
Infra ..|> App : liideste teostus
Api --> Infra : DI registreerimine
Infra --> Db : EF Core
Worker --> Api : HTTP (Service roll)
@enduml
